                // github_* PR tools take pullRequestId. Verified live against the
                // v1.7.256 schema: pullRequestId → "Required parameter
                // 'pullRequestID' is missing". Same conclusion in repo history
                // #193 (dc48d6b1) and #201 (92aea814).
