GitLab date: `root.created_at ? root.created_at.substring(0, 10) : ''` — root always {} at least. `_gitlabThreadDate(root)` handles null too ✓. Reply: same fields ✓. Current reply author: `reply.author ? (reply.author.username || reply.author.name) : 'unknown'` ✓ same as _gitlabThreadAuthor(reply.author).

Current GitLab thread numbering: push happens BEFORE resolved check ✓ same as mine (push then `if (mapped.resolved) return`).

GitLab markdown: `'# PR Discussion History\n_Previous review discussions for MR #' + prId + '._\n' + sections.join('\n')` ✓.

