+// ── GitLab MR discussion helpers (gh-925) ────────────────────────────────────
+// Pure mappers/renderers extracted from _createGitLabProvider().fetchDiscussions
+// (CRAP 648.7 in the baseline). Behaviour-preserving — pinned by
